line Diagrammo Download Size per Release
// Compressed size of each package file a user downloads, at every published version (last of each day). npm packages from registry.npmjs.org; the Obsidian plugin is its GitHub release files (main.js, styles.css, manifest.json, not compressed). The desktop app is its Mac installer (.dmg) from the diagrammo/releases GitHub repo; there is no Windows or Linux installer there. The five doc-site wrappers (Astro, Docusaurus, Fumadocs, Nextra, VitePress) are summed into one panel. 0 = not published yet. Measured 2026-11-26.
